1
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:16,307
Huh?

2
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:21,521
Shampoo!

3
00:00:22,355 --> 00:00:23,982
Ranma, you're dead.

4
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:27,610
The Chinese Amazons
are a very proud people.

5
00:00:28,194 --> 00:00:31,614
Losing to an outsider
is a dishonor worse than death.

6
00:00:32,699 --> 00:00:34,701
The Kiss of Death is a solemn vow,

7
00:00:34,784 --> 00:00:37,245
one that requires her to chase you down
to the depths of hell

8
00:00:37,328 --> 00:00:39,456
in pursuit of killing you.

9
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:43,626
And don't come in someone's house
to pick a fight!

10
00:00:46,713 --> 00:00:48,423
Well, that's no good.

11
00:00:48,506 --> 00:00:49,507
Poor girl.

12
00:00:49,591 --> 00:00:52,886
I guess this means
she ended up losing a second time.

13
00:00:54,554 --> 00:00:56,598
This was all an accident
and you did not lose.

14
00:00:56,681 --> 00:00:57,974
Liar!

15
00:00:59,017 --> 00:01:01,603
Now accept your Kiss of Death
with some dignity.

16
00:01:02,729 --> 00:01:03,730
Hmm.

17
00:01:10,528 --> 00:01:12,489
Mmm, mmm?

18
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:21,498
RANMA1/2

19
00:02:49,878 --> 00:02:51,796
YOU I LOVE

20
00:03:02,390 --> 00:03:03,391
Ah.

21
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,529
What could be causing all this racket?

22
00:03:16,613 --> 00:03:18,323
Oh, Dad, it's you.

23
00:03:18,406 --> 00:03:21,993
Well, to be honest, I'm not really sure
what's going on here.

24
00:03:22,076 --> 00:03:24,412
Ranma's ex-lover from China came over,
broke into the house

25
00:03:24,495 --> 00:03:26,623
and started demanding
that they get back together.

26
00:03:26,706 --> 00:03:27,707
His ex-lover?

27
00:03:27,790 --> 00:03:31,044
If you're feeling that flustered,
you shouldn't go rattling your mouth off!

28
00:03:31,127 --> 00:03:33,880
Although it is surprisingly accurate,
isn't it?

29
00:03:33,963 --> 00:03:36,799
This has been the first time
she's ever seen me in my male form.

30
00:03:36,883 --> 00:03:39,302
Well if that's the case,
you two seem pretty close.

31
00:03:39,385 --> 00:03:41,346
What's your relationship with Shampoo?

32
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:42,513
Aiyaa.

33
00:03:42,597 --> 00:03:45,016
Akane, listen to me.

34
00:03:45,516 --> 00:03:46,517
What do you want?

35
00:03:48,853 --> 00:03:51,689
Do whatever you want then.

36
00:03:51,773 --> 00:03:55,777
All right. If you're all gonna see me
like that, I guess I can't stop you.

37
00:03:56,277 --> 00:03:57,111
Ranma.

38
00:03:57,195 --> 00:03:59,239
That's the only way we're able to see it.

39
00:03:59,322 --> 00:04:00,448
YEP

40
00:04:01,532 --> 00:04:03,743
Fine, then. Let's call off the engagement!

41
00:04:03,826 --> 00:04:05,662
Ranma and I don't need to get married.

42
00:04:07,789 --> 00:04:08,873
Akane!

43
00:04:09,666 --> 00:04:12,335
- Hey, Shampoo. You gotta get off me.
- Now then, Ranma.

44
00:04:12,418 --> 00:04:13,461
Ah.

45
00:04:14,671 --> 00:04:18,091
Let's hear what pitiful explanation
you have to offer me.

46
00:04:18,174 --> 00:04:19,759
I-I keep trying to tell you,

47
00:04:19,842 --> 00:04:22,220
- I-I have no idea what's going on.
- Poke, poke.

48
00:04:22,303 --> 00:04:23,471
- Huh?
- Hmm?

49
00:04:23,554 --> 00:04:25,348
CHINESE AMAZON SUTRA

50
00:04:25,431 --> 00:04:26,474
Look.

51
00:04:27,934 --> 00:04:31,229
Let's see here. "Laws of Chinese Amazons"...

52
00:04:37,652 --> 00:04:39,237
No! It can't be!

53
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:41,239
What does the book say?

54
00:04:41,322 --> 00:04:42,448
You idiot!

55
00:04:42,532 --> 00:04:44,242
I don't know how to read Chinese!

56
00:04:44,325 --> 00:04:47,245
If you're gonna yell at me,
you should wait until you stop crying!

57
00:04:47,328 --> 00:04:49,914
"The Laws of the Chinese Amazons."

58
00:04:49,998 --> 00:04:52,625
Nabiki, welcome home.
It's good to have you back.

59
00:04:52,709 --> 00:04:54,544
Uh...

60
00:04:55,712 --> 00:04:59,382
"Should one of our female warriors
ever be defeated by an outsider,

61
00:04:59,465 --> 00:05:01,968
in the case of a female-gendered opponent,

62
00:05:02,051 --> 00:05:04,262
she must receive the Kiss of Death

63
00:05:04,929 --> 00:05:06,180
and then be killed.

64
00:05:07,223 --> 00:05:10,643
However, in the case
of the male-gendered opponent,

65
00:05:11,686 --> 00:05:13,730
you must make him your husband."

66
00:05:17,692 --> 00:05:19,277
What? Huh?

67
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,820
- You're making that up!
- Mmm, mmm.

68
00:05:20,903 --> 00:05:23,489
Do I look like someone
that would joke around about this?

69
00:05:23,573 --> 00:05:24,574
Yes, you do!

70
00:05:24,657 --> 00:05:26,951
Do you even know
how to read Chinese to begin with?

71
00:05:27,452 --> 00:05:28,369
Huh?

72
00:05:28,453 --> 00:05:29,787
- Of course.
- Huh?

73
00:05:30,288 --> 00:05:31,873
Just kidding. I don't know how.

74
00:05:33,207 --> 00:05:35,626
But there is a Japanese translation
in the margin.

75
00:05:35,710 --> 00:05:38,463
Oh, yeah. Look at that!

76
00:05:39,088 --> 00:05:41,799
There it is. I missed it!

77
00:05:42,842 --> 00:05:45,261
Ranma, you moron.

78
00:05:45,345 --> 00:05:46,763
You're an idiot!

79
00:05:46,846 --> 00:05:50,141
Stupid......you are so unbelievable.

80
00:05:50,224 --> 00:05:53,227
You stupid, freaking, idiot!

81
00:05:55,021 --> 00:05:57,315
You stupid Ranma!

82
00:06:02,195 --> 00:06:04,447
I think I feel better.

83
00:06:12,872 --> 00:06:17,085
I know we're engaged, but that was
something our fathers chose for us.

84
00:06:18,169 --> 00:06:22,340
At the end of the day, it's not
like we actually liked each other.

85
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:27,011
Listen up! Akane is already engaged to me.

86
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:29,722
And if you touch her again, I'll kill you.

87
00:06:47,782 --> 00:06:48,783
Hmm.

88
00:06:52,453 --> 00:06:54,664
- J-Just listen to me, Shampoo.
- Hmm?

89
00:06:54,747 --> 00:06:56,999
It's the modern day.

90
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:59,460
You can't have laws
that make you kill women who best you

91
00:06:59,544 --> 00:07:02,171
and you can't require
that a man has to marry you either.

92
00:07:02,255 --> 00:07:05,216
Those sorts of laws
are just outdated nonsense.

93
00:07:05,299 --> 00:07:06,342
There are laws?

94
00:07:06,843 --> 00:07:08,469
So, in a nutshell...

95
00:07:09,095 --> 00:07:11,556
The textbook definition of trapping a man.

96
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:13,599
Where did you two come from?

97
00:07:14,267 --> 00:07:17,812
So what do you say to making up
with Ranma? Well, Akane?

98
00:07:18,354 --> 00:07:19,730
And let's be real,

99
00:07:19,814 --> 00:07:23,151
do you think that Ranma has the ability
to get a girlfriend on his own?

100
00:07:28,781 --> 00:07:30,575
What do you say? Do you get it?

101
00:07:31,159 --> 00:07:32,535
Mm-hmm.

102
00:07:32,618 --> 00:07:34,203
Wo de ai ren.

103
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:37,582
You didn't get any of that, did you?

104
00:07:38,166 --> 00:07:40,710
Let's check out "Wo de ai ren."

105
00:07:40,793 --> 00:07:42,420
This says it means "my husband."

106
00:07:44,672 --> 00:07:46,841
What I'm trying to say is...

107
00:07:46,924 --> 00:07:49,927
I'm not really interested in
being in a relationship with...

108
00:07:51,262 --> 00:07:52,597
...you?

109
00:07:54,265 --> 00:07:56,601
Wo ai ni.

110
00:07:59,937 --> 00:08:02,565
I'm trying to tell you

111
00:08:02,648 --> 00:08:06,027
there's nothing between the two of us.

112
00:08:06,110 --> 00:08:10,072
And, really, who cares if there is a law
because I'm definitely not m-marrying you.

113
00:08:10,156 --> 00:08:12,116
I mean, it'd be ridiculous
to do something like that...

114
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:14,285
- Let's see if "Wo ai ni" is listed.
- ...not to mention old-fashioned...

115
00:08:14,368 --> 00:08:15,453
- Yeah, it's right there.
- ...inappropriate...

116
00:08:15,536 --> 00:08:17,288
- It means "I love you."
- ...a second to think about it.

117
00:08:17,371 --> 00:08:20,458
Why do they have to be so loud?

118
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:23,419
So anyway, like I was trying to tell you,

119
00:08:23,503 --> 00:08:25,296
I just think that... I think we should take

120
00:08:25,379 --> 00:08:27,256
more time to learn
about each other.

121
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:30,051
I'm not a fan of the idea of marrying
someone I don't even

122
00:08:30,134 --> 00:08:31,302
know...

123
00:08:31,385 --> 00:08:34,555
Oh, dear. Look at how wound up he is.

124
00:08:35,056 --> 00:08:37,058
It's fun watching them, huh, Aka...

125
00:08:45,691 --> 00:08:46,859
Ai ren!

126
00:08:46,943 --> 00:08:47,985
LISTEN TO YOURSELF, DOLT!

127
00:09:01,207 --> 00:09:05,127
I don't think I noticed it before because
she was trying to kill me the whole time...

128
00:09:06,128 --> 00:09:08,548
Wo ai ni.

129
00:09:09,757 --> 00:09:12,301
...but Shampoo is actually pretty cute.

130
00:09:12,843 --> 00:09:15,721
I wish Akane was
as up-front as Shampoo is.

131
00:09:17,306 --> 00:09:18,724
That's cold!

132
00:09:24,355 --> 00:09:27,608
You know, earlier today...

133
00:09:27,692 --> 00:09:29,860
...when I saw Akane
getting jealous over you...

134
00:09:32,238 --> 00:09:34,407
...it really hurt my freaking feelings!

135
00:09:36,492 --> 00:09:38,869
You moron. Why would I care about that?

136
00:09:40,037 --> 00:09:42,957
You might as well stick around as a girl
and then Shampoo can come back

137
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,667
- and beat you up.
- Argh!

138
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:48,337
Well, I hope that you get stuck as a pig
and then eaten by Akane!

139
00:09:48,421 --> 00:09:51,007
Don't call me a pig!

140
00:09:51,090 --> 00:09:52,216
Pig.

141
00:09:52,300 --> 00:09:55,303
That's right. I almost forgot!
Your name is P-chan, isn't it?

142
00:09:55,386 --> 00:09:59,098
Why, you...

143
00:10:09,692 --> 00:10:13,112
I think you should take a dip
and cool off.

144
00:10:17,408 --> 00:10:19,160
Ha!

145
00:10:19,243 --> 00:10:20,411
That's what you get.

146
00:10:23,539 --> 00:10:27,043
'Cause we both know, it's not
like Akane has any reason to be jealous...

147
00:10:32,381 --> 00:10:33,341
Uh-oh.

148
00:10:33,424 --> 00:10:35,968
Oh, I'm not upset. Why would I be?

149
00:10:36,469 --> 00:10:38,137
I mean, just think about it.

150
00:10:38,220 --> 00:10:40,598
It's not like the two of us
are engaged anymore.

151
00:10:40,681 --> 00:10:43,267
Um, well, what I was saying was...

152
00:10:43,351 --> 00:10:44,685
You two are more than welcome

153
00:10:44,769 --> 00:10:46,520
to go ahead and get to know each other!

154
00:10:48,022 --> 00:10:49,940
P-chan, come on.

155
00:10:57,740 --> 00:10:59,617
Ak-kane?

156
00:11:02,953 --> 00:11:04,455
I'll kill you!

157
00:11:05,873 --> 00:11:07,375
Hey, can we talk this out first?

158
00:11:07,458 --> 00:11:08,459
I'll kill you!

159
00:11:09,502 --> 00:11:11,337
You gotta give me a br--

160
00:11:13,172 --> 00:11:15,383
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

161
00:11:16,175 --> 00:11:17,468
Wait! W-w-wait...

162
00:11:18,344 --> 00:11:20,137
You're really dangerous!

163
00:11:21,514 --> 00:11:22,890
Would you please cut it out?

164
00:11:24,892 --> 00:11:26,018
I'll kill you!

165
00:11:27,478 --> 00:11:29,146
I'll kill you!

166
00:11:31,565 --> 00:11:34,694
So it seems to me,
when he's a boy she wants him,

167
00:11:34,777 --> 00:11:36,904
but when he's a girl,
she just wants him dead.

168
00:11:36,987 --> 00:11:38,698
I'll kill you!

169
00:11:38,781 --> 00:11:40,825
Yeah, those two need to learn
more about each other

170
00:11:40,908 --> 00:11:42,993
before they get into a relationship.

171
00:11:43,077 --> 00:11:45,579
I'll kill you!

172
00:11:47,998 --> 00:11:49,917
Stupid Ranma.

173
00:12:00,052 --> 00:12:01,512
ANYTHING GOES
MARTIAL ARTS TENDO DOJO

174
00:12:01,595 --> 00:12:03,472
P-chan, where are you?

175
00:12:03,973 --> 00:12:06,183
I guess P-chan must have run off again.

176
00:12:09,353 --> 00:12:11,522
Oh! Hello, Akane.

177
00:12:11,605 --> 00:12:13,482
Would you mind going to wake up Ranma?

178
00:12:13,983 --> 00:12:15,818
And why do I have to do it?

179
00:12:15,901 --> 00:12:17,319
No specific reason.

180
00:12:17,403 --> 00:12:19,405
You've got a death grip on that grudge.

181
00:12:19,488 --> 00:12:21,198
Still mad about Ranma and Shampoo?

182
00:12:21,282 --> 00:12:23,409
No, I'm not.

183
00:12:23,492 --> 00:12:25,703
Akane.

184
00:12:26,787 --> 00:12:30,499
What do you say we try being a little more
up-front with our feelings for a while?

185
00:12:31,584 --> 00:12:34,044
What do you mean?

186
00:12:35,337 --> 00:12:38,257
She's scary!

187
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:41,051
- I was scared!
- It's okay, Papa. You'll be all right.

188
00:12:41,135 --> 00:12:43,345
There's nothing for you to cry about.

189
00:12:44,430 --> 00:12:46,807
Ranma, how late are you sleeping in?

190
00:12:52,646 --> 00:12:53,856
Wo de ai ren.

191
00:12:59,945 --> 00:13:01,781
Cold!

192
00:13:04,283 --> 00:13:06,535
What the hell was that for, Akane?

193
00:13:06,619 --> 00:13:08,829
You tryin' to fight this early, you--

194
00:13:08,913 --> 00:13:10,414
Wo de ai ren.

195
00:13:10,498 --> 00:13:14,251
Shampoo,
what are you doing in my bed?

196
00:13:19,882 --> 00:13:21,175
- Hmm.
- Hmm?

197
00:13:23,469 --> 00:13:25,179
I'll kill you!

198
00:13:25,262 --> 00:13:27,723
I wish I knew what your problem was!

199
00:13:29,058 --> 00:13:30,434
I'll kill you!

200
00:13:30,518 --> 00:13:33,103
Oh, my. I didn't realize Shampoo was here.

201
00:13:33,604 --> 00:13:34,814
Hmm?

202
00:13:36,941 --> 00:13:38,484
Let me be clear.

203
00:13:38,567 --> 00:13:41,362
I had no idea Shampoo snuck into my bed.

204
00:13:41,445 --> 00:13:43,572
Hmm, that's funny.
I don't remember asking.

205
00:13:44,156 --> 00:13:45,950
It's too early for that anyway.

206
00:13:46,659 --> 00:13:49,411
You really are determined
not to listen to people.

207
00:13:49,495 --> 00:13:52,206
I mean, you cuddle the pig
while you're sleeping, right?

208
00:13:52,289 --> 00:13:54,166
What does P-chan have to do with this?

209
00:13:56,961 --> 00:13:59,630
Only an idiot feels
like they're competing with a pig.

210
00:14:00,798 --> 00:14:03,926
Yeah, right. Like anyone
would get jealous over you anyway.

211
00:14:06,428 --> 00:14:07,680
So sorry!

212
00:14:07,763 --> 00:14:10,140
My hand must have slipped.

213
00:14:10,224 --> 00:14:12,518
You know this is why
you're never gonna be cute.

214
00:14:12,601 --> 00:14:14,520
I already told you I'm fine with that.

215
00:14:20,734 --> 00:14:22,194
Akane.

216
00:14:22,778 --> 00:14:26,198
My next journey calls,
so I'm leaving without saying goodbye.

217
00:14:31,036 --> 00:14:33,289
I can see now that I'm just your pet.

218
00:14:33,372 --> 00:14:35,541
I'll never be more than P-chan to you.

219
00:14:37,501 --> 00:14:40,421
We know
that Ranma's infidelity hurts Akane.

220
00:14:40,504 --> 00:14:44,174
If we're gonna home-wreck,
now's the time to do it.

221
00:14:44,258 --> 00:14:45,885
Do you hear yourself?

222
00:14:45,968 --> 00:14:47,511
Shut your halo!

223
00:14:47,595 --> 00:14:50,264
I want you to remember
what Ranma's done to you.

224
00:14:50,347 --> 00:14:53,642
Why do you think it is that Akane
only sees you as a pet in the first place?

225
00:14:55,019 --> 00:14:56,812
Now's the time
for you to take your chance.

226
00:14:56,896 --> 00:14:58,230
No, that wouldn't be right.

227
00:14:58,314 --> 00:14:59,857
I bet if you can be patient enough,

228
00:14:59,940 --> 00:15:02,526
that girl from China
will just end up killing Ranma anyway.

229
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:04,570
Let that moment be your chance.

230
00:15:04,653 --> 00:15:06,697
That's way more nefarious than my idea!

231
00:15:06,780 --> 00:15:08,741
What need is there
to get your own hands dirty?

232
00:15:08,824 --> 00:15:10,618
Good things come to those who wait.

233
00:15:10,701 --> 00:15:11,577
But I...

234
00:15:11,660 --> 00:15:14,079
Interrupt them now,
so you can strike while the iron's hot.

235
00:15:14,163 --> 00:15:15,748
No, it's far too early for you to act.

236
00:15:15,831 --> 00:15:17,750
Calm down!

237
00:15:18,334 --> 00:15:20,044
I'm so sorry, Ryoga.

238
00:15:20,544 --> 00:15:24,673
Because what I feel
for Ranma is love.

239
00:15:25,299 --> 00:15:27,176
If something like that were to happen,

240
00:15:28,469 --> 00:15:32,264
my oh-too-fragile heart
would shatter into tiny pieces.

241
00:15:33,682 --> 00:15:36,143
Farewell, Akane.

242
00:15:57,247 --> 00:15:58,248
Hmm.

243
00:16:01,293 --> 00:16:03,379
I thought we'd never make it to lunch.

244
00:16:03,462 --> 00:16:05,172
I'm so hungry.

245
00:16:08,008 --> 00:16:10,260
- Huh?
- That can't be good.

246
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:12,554
What in the...

247
00:16:12,638 --> 00:16:14,098
- Does it sound like it's getting closer?
- Hmm?

248
00:16:17,643 --> 00:16:18,894
Hmm?

249
00:16:20,938 --> 00:16:22,731
Hello, male Ranma.

250
00:16:22,815 --> 00:16:24,900
Shampoo, are you serious right now?

251
00:16:25,985 --> 00:16:27,903
What the hell do you want?

252
00:16:28,487 --> 00:16:30,906
I made you a bento box.

253
00:16:35,285 --> 00:16:36,370
- Hmm?
- Hmm?

254
00:16:48,132 --> 00:16:49,717
P-chan!

255
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:50,676
Huh?

256
00:16:50,759 --> 00:16:52,219
What do you think you're doing?

257
00:16:52,302 --> 00:16:54,430
- Um, uh...
- Say "ah."

258
00:16:54,513 --> 00:16:56,056
Hey, hey.

259
00:16:56,807 --> 00:16:58,600
Wake up, hey!

260
00:16:58,684 --> 00:17:00,394
Ow!

261
00:17:02,229 --> 00:17:05,774
Oh, you're okay, P-chan.

262
00:17:15,826 --> 00:17:17,244
Huh?

263
00:17:28,881 --> 00:17:29,757
No.

264
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:31,050
The Kiss of Death?

265
00:17:34,595 --> 00:17:35,846
So it's like that.

266
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:39,558
I won't back down.
I accept your challenge.

267
00:17:41,143 --> 00:17:43,812
Hey, now, the pig is alive
so why don't we all just calm down?

268
00:17:43,896 --> 00:17:45,522
No more!

269
00:17:46,148 --> 00:17:49,526
After everything she's done to me,
I'm gonna settle this.

270
00:17:50,319 --> 00:17:53,655
Doesn't anything get through
to that thick head of yours?

271
00:17:54,364 --> 00:17:56,658
You don't stand a chance
at beating Shampoo--

272
00:17:56,742 --> 00:17:58,410
You're the one with a thick head.

273
00:17:58,494 --> 00:18:00,412
- Watch out!
- What?

274
00:18:05,125 --> 00:18:07,419
'Kay, P-chan. You should be safe here.

275
00:18:09,546 --> 00:18:11,757
I'm gonna be fine. Don't worry about me.

276
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:19,515
The Kiss of Death.

277
00:18:19,598 --> 00:18:22,142
I'll hunt you down to the depths of hell,

278
00:18:22,226 --> 00:18:23,310
and kill you.

279
00:18:23,393 --> 00:18:25,020
Oh, don't worry.

280
00:18:25,104 --> 00:18:26,563
'Cause I'm not going anywhere.

281
00:18:27,272 --> 00:18:28,982
I'm putting an end to this here.

282
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:35,614
Hey! Hey! You all right?

283
00:18:35,697 --> 00:18:37,491
Oh, man.

284
00:18:37,574 --> 00:18:39,576
Guess the ball must have popped him
pretty good.

285
00:18:43,789 --> 00:18:45,207
Akane!

286
00:18:45,290 --> 00:18:46,834
She already went through there.

287
00:18:47,751 --> 00:18:50,295
What the hell?

288
00:18:56,009 --> 00:18:57,594
Akane.

289
00:18:59,346 --> 00:19:01,765
Akane!

290
00:19:16,530 --> 00:19:17,906
Akane.

291
00:19:33,005 --> 00:19:34,173
Akane!

292
00:19:50,772 --> 00:19:51,899
Akane.

293
00:19:51,982 --> 00:19:53,317
Akane!

294
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:56,528
Akane! Akane! Akane!

295
00:19:58,906 --> 00:20:00,449
Whoa.

296
00:20:05,913 --> 00:20:08,582
Akane!

297
00:20:15,088 --> 00:20:16,381
Ryoga.

298
00:20:29,478 --> 00:20:32,022
Akane!

299
00:20:32,105 --> 00:20:33,106
Hey.

300
00:20:34,358 --> 00:20:37,027
Hey, come on, wake up!

301
00:20:41,657 --> 00:20:46,662
Akane!

302
00:21:00,425 --> 00:21:01,593
Akane!

303
00:21:02,469 --> 00:21:03,553
Huh?

304
00:21:04,388 --> 00:21:05,764
What happened?

305
00:21:12,187 --> 00:21:13,563
You're up? You idiot!

306
00:21:14,314 --> 00:21:16,024
That's why I told you not to do it.

307
00:21:19,194 --> 00:21:20,195
Hmm?

308
00:21:21,196 --> 00:21:22,489
Ak-kane?

309
00:21:25,575 --> 00:21:27,577
Do I know you?

310
00:21:28,078 --> 00:21:29,121
Hmm?
